    "detailed_description": "<i>A game designed for players seeking adrenaline and challenges.</i> <br><strong>Missman</strong> is a 2D platformer that tests your limits and patience. <br>You embody a <u>secret agent assassin</u>, armed with a unique pistol. <br><br>Your objective? <i>To eliminate a high-placed target</i> at the end of an obstacle-laden course.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Propulsion</strong>: Use your pistol to create impact zones and propel yourself through levels.<br></li><li><strong>Continuous Challenges</strong>: Expect to lose progress and start over, testing your resilience and ability to overcome frustration.<br></li><li><strong>Diverse Environments</strong>: Traverse various urban settings, each with its own unique obstacles and traps.<br></li><li><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong>: A mix of strategy, skill, and patience.<br></li><li><strong>One Level, Multiple Challenges</strong>: A continuous journey that takes you ever higher, demanding perfect mastery of the game mechanics.</li></ul><br>Missman is not just a game, it's a test of perseverance. <br><br><strong><i>Are you ready to take on the challenge?</i></strong>",
